{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】荃灣清晨有單位起火，無人受傷。</p>\n<p>警方及消防員到場，協助約一百名住戶疏散到地下。</p>\n<p>警方清晨5時許接報，荃灣青山公路623號樓上一個單位起火。消防派出煙帽隊開喉灌救，約40分鐘後將火救熄。火警中無人受傷，起火原因有待調查。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:44:29.934669+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T23:19:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T23:37:52.490427+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T23:37:52.490427+00:00","content_hash":"b8f6b1f8d6547b5f37808de8979d1957051ca9354f3b44b09149b5b3a9438e2d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}